{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一块大号白色粗体文字，粉色竖线强化了入口。随后容易被下方第二块同样大号、同样明亮的白色粗体文字吸引。两块视觉权重接近，缺少明确的主次。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"仍被过去与那些人的经历牵动，对当初受过的气感到不服气，连过去开心的事也不愿多想。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈；难受和悲伤是否是此刻的核心感受，不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"不服气已经随着内心争执和疲惫逐渐淡去，如今因为已经不在那些人身边而感到难受。这一层情绪转变及其原因需要读第二块完整句子才能明确。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大号文字争夺主视线，第一眼不容易判断哪一块才是核心。\",\n    \"单块较长，各自包含多层意思，需要读完整句子才能理清。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块：上面讲过去的委屈和回忆，下面讲不服气消退及当下的难受，需要拼接才能理解完整的处境、感受及其关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9473b137-f104-4e1e-9361-89673f03ce4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032954370344Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:30:17.321875+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "42e7876c680686921b0f5ac33eea4c80da6fdf350c1d8bb615a6096dce11309f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4